category: Devel
requires: cppunit cygwin libgcc1 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Streaming protocol for test results (runtime)"
ldesc: "Subunit is a streaming protocol for test results. The protocol is a binary
encoding that is easily generated and parsed. By design all the components of
the protocol conceptually fit into the xUnit TestCase->TestResult interaction."
external-source: subunit

